{"id":"17-2974-2-20","zh":"在被动语态中，依“tassa cavagga”等规则，ya 词缀连同 d 变为 j，并且重复：tujjate、tujjante。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-2974-21-27","zh":"也作 tujjati、tujjanti，或 tujjare。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2974-28-32","zh":"同样，命令式为 tudatu、tudantu。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2974-33-38","zh":"愿望式为 tude、tudeyya、tudeyyuṃ。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2974-39-42","zh":"今天时为 atudi、tudiṃsu。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2974-43-46","zh":"atudi、atudittha。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2974-47-50","zh":"atudiṃ、atudimha。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2974-51-54","zh":"被动为 atujjittha、atujji。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2974-55-56","zh":"将来时为 tudissati。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2974-57-59","zh":"条件式为 atudissa，等等。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2975-2-12","zh":"词根 visa，义为“进入”，前面加 pa：他进入村子，pavisati、pavisanti。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2975-13-16","zh":"pavisasi、pavisatha。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2975-17-20","zh":"pavisāmi、pavisāma。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2976-2-7","zh":"在被动语态中为 pavisiyyate、pavisiyyante。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2976-8-11","zh":"也作 pavisiyyati、pavisiyyanti。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2976-12-14","zh":"或作 pavissate。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2976-15-19","zh":"同样，命令式为 pavisatu、pavisantu。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2976-20-21","zh":"愿望式为 paviseyya。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2976-22-41","zh":"今天时为 pāvisi、pavisi；又如“pāvekkhi pathaviṃ（进入了大地）”，这是依“kvaci dhātū”等规则，在今天时中把 visa 替代为 vekkha。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-2976-42-45","zh":"pāvisiṃsu、pavisiṃsu。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2977-2-10","zh":"在被动语态中为 pāvisīyittha、pavisīyittha、pāvisīyi、pavisīyi。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2977-11-14","zh":"将来时为 pavisissati、pavisissanti。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2977-15-18","zh":"被动为 pavisīyissate、pavisissate。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2977-19-20","zh":"条件式为 pāvisissa。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2977-21-23","zh":"被动为 pāvisīyissa，等等。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2978-2-8","zh":"词根 nuda，义为“推除”：nudati、nudanti。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2979-2-9","zh":"词根 disa，义为“指示、授予”：uddisati、uddisanti。","confidence":65}
{"id":"17-2980-2-8","zh":"词根 likha，义为“书写”：likhati、likhanti。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2981-2-9","zh":"词根 phusa，义为“接触”：phusati、phusanti，等等。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2982-2-3","zh":"以上是 tuda 类词根的变化法。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2983-2-45","zh":"词根 hū、bhū，义为“存在”：生出 ti 等语尾后，依“bhūvādito a”加 a 词缀；承接“vā”，依“lopañcettamakāro”，bhū 等词根后面的 a 词缀省略；再依“aññesu ca”强化元音。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-2983-46-61","zh":"他存在（hoti），他们存在（honti）；这是依“kvaci dhātū”等规则省略了后一个元音。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2983-62-65","zh":"hosi、hotha。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2983-66-69","zh":"homi、homa。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2983-70-72","zh":"在无人称语态中为 hūyate。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2984-2-6","zh":"同样，命令式为 hotu、hontu。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2984-7-16","zh":"hohi——因为 hi 前面不是 a，所以 hi 不省略；hotha。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-2984-17-20","zh":"homi、homa。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2984-21-23","zh":"在无人称语态中为 hūyataṃ。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2985-2-8","zh":"在愿望式中，经元音省略等变化，得 heyya、heyyuṃ。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2985-9-12","zh":"heyyāsi、heyyātha。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2985-13-16","zh":"heyyāmi、heyyāma。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2985-17-19","zh":"或作 heyyaṃ。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2985-20-22","zh":"在无人称语态中为 hūyetha。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2986-2-19","zh":"在昨天时中，a 词缀省略后，依“kvaci dhātū”等规则，把词根 hū 的 ū 替代为 uva。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-2986-20-25","zh":"ahuvā、ahuvu、ahuvū。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2986-26-31","zh":"ahuva、ahuvo、ahuvattha。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2986-32-35","zh":"ahuvaṃ、ahuvamha。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2986-36-39","zh":"ahuvattha、ahuvatthuṃ。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2986-40-43","zh":"ahuvase、ahuvavhaṃ。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2986-44-47","zh":"ahuviṃ、ahuvamhase。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2986-48-50","zh":"在无人称语态中为 ahūyattha。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2987-2-55","zh":"在今天时中，依“kvaci dhātū”等规则，hū 后面的 ī 语尾省略，并且元音变短：他曾存在（so ahu）。不省略时，把“karassa kāsattamajjatanimhī”这条规则拆分，取出“sattamajjatanimhī”，据此加上增音 s，再强化元音：ahosi、ahesuṃ；这里依“kvaci dhātū”等规则，把 o 变为 e。","confidence":60}
{"id":"17-2987-56-58","zh":"或作 ahavuṃ。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2987-59-62","zh":"ahosi、ahosittha。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2987-63-77","zh":"ahosiṃ、ahuṃ——这里后一个元音省略并且变短；ahosimha、ahumha——这里元音变短。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-2987-78-80","zh":"在无人称语态中为 ahūyittha。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2988-2-21","zh":"从“hi lopaṃ vā”这条规则承接“lopo”和“vā”两项。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-2989-2-10","zh":"490. 在将来时语尾前，hū 的元音变为 eha、oha、e，ssa 也〔可省略〕。","confidence":65}
{"id":"17-2990-2-19","zh":"词根 hū 的元音，在将来时语尾前变为 eha、oha、e，并且 ssa 可以省略。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-2990-20-24","zh":"加上增音 i，经元音省略等变化。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2991-2-5","zh":"hehiti、hehinti。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2991-6-9","zh":"hehisi、hehitha。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2991-10-13","zh":"hehāmi、hehāma。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2991-14-19","zh":"不省略时：hehissati、hehissanti。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2991-20-23","zh":"hehissasi、hehissatha。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2991-24-27","zh":"hehissāmi、hehissāma。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2991-28-33","zh":"替代为 oha 时：hohiti、hohinti。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2991-34-37","zh":"hohisi、hohitha。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2991-38-41","zh":"hohāmi、hohāma。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2991-42-46","zh":"同样，hohissati、hohissanti。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2991-47-50","zh":"hohissasi、hohissatha。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2991-51-54","zh":"hohissāmi、hohissāma。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2991-55-60","zh":"替代为 e 时：heti、henti。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2991-61-64","zh":"hesi、hetha。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2991-65-69","zh":"hemi、hema。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2991-70-73","zh":"hessati、hessanti。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2991-74-77","zh":"hessasi、hessatha。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2991-78-81","zh":"hessāmi、hessāma。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2991-82-84","zh":"在无人称语态中为 hūyissate。","confidence":75}
